    "title": "Lead Revenue Manager at SOTC Travel",
    "description": "We at SOTC Travel are looking for an experienced Revenue Manager based out of Madurai. If you are a result-oriented professional with a passion for excellence, we want to hear from you.\n\nAbout SOTC Travel:\nSOTC Travel is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Conduct regular guest satisfaction surveys and implement improvements\n• Ensure compliance with FSSAI, health, and safety regulations\n• Handle guest complaints and resolve issues promptly\n• Manage reservations and optimize room revenue through yield management\n• Develop and maintain relationships with corporate clients\n• Manage procurement of hotel supplies and control operating costs\n• Coordinate with travel agents and OTAs for occupancy optimization\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in HACCP\n• Proficiency in Revenue Management\n• Proficiency in Yield Management\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in Travel Management\n• Proficiency in MICE\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in Housekeeping Standards\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Flexible working hours\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Madurai, Tamil Nadu, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with SOTC Travel!",
